            "oldString": "    def _find_scroll_container(self, analyzer) -> Optional[tuple]:\n        \"\"\"从控件树识别可滚动容器，返回其 bounds (x1,y1,x2,y2)。\n\n        优先找最大的 List/Scroll/Grid 容器（这些是确切的滚动区域），\n        找不到时回退到整屏中线（旧逻辑）。容器 bounds 保证滑动落在\n        真正可滚动的区域，避免页面\"部分区域可滑动\"时滑到固定内容区。\n        \"\"\"\n        import re\n        candidates = []\n        for w in analyzer.widgets:\n            t = (w.get('type') or '').lower()\n            if t not in ('list', 'listitemgroup', 'grid', 'scroll'):\n                continue\n            nums = re.findall(r'\\d+', w.get('bounds', '') or '')\n            if len(nums) < 4:\n                continue\n            x1, y1, x2, y2 = (int(n) for n in nums[:4])\n            if y2 - y1 < 80:  # 太矮的容器不适合滑动\n                continue\n            candidates.append((x1, y1, x2, y2))\n        if not candidates:\n            return None\n        # 取面积最大的容器\n        return max(candidates, key=lambda b: (b[2] - b[0]) * (b[3] - b[1]))"
